  "implementation": [
    "Full and virtual surfaces consume the same Studio native-row/styled-card slots. Only Favorites reads its private default-false key; queue/playlist remain full-rendered.",
    "VirtualTable opts into existing bounded retention and anchor helpers; natural tbody units register only mounted interaction targets, including context handoff and cleanup.",
    "Parent continuity waits for its lazy delegate; the virtual surface supplies complete geometry, temporary anchor suspension and bounded mount-before-focus retention. Root-owned track dialogs retain their opener.",
    "Viewport selection follows Studio content/desk overflow styles and bounded resize observation, without changing scroll containers or host business/storage/media ownership."
  ],
